        <activityName xml:lang="en">Beamer, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Beamer, at plant
The dataset is taken from the LCA study of typical beamers/projectors; UUID: 37420479-8999-3e55-93a8-c26811845307
This dataset represents the model for a standard beamer/projector, with a total weight of approximately 2.8 kg. The components include chasing, inner chassis, optical components, and electrical components.
Location: Data for global average projectors.
Technology: Average video projectors with chasis materials and electronic hardware/components inside.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_37420479-8999-3e55-93a8-c26811845307.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
